{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id36869266"}, "name":{"label":"mrowell"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-21T19:08:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13297672156"}, "title":{"label":"Another Great Upgrade"}, "content":{"label":"Version 6 - Even better. The best podcast app around. \n\nThe Smart Speed feature that removes pauses has saved me over two weeks of listening time. Given I use podcasts for professional development, that one little feature has let me listen to an extra 352 hours of podcasts, that is a lot of knowledge gained. Over a month of lectures at 8hrs/day. \n\nThanks Marco.\n\n\nUpdate Oct 2025.\n\nGreat ongoing refinements lately. Smart speed has saved me over 500hrs now.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
