{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id134109574"}, "name":{"label":"Arglebarf"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-12T21:11:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.9"}, "id":{"label":"13130958359"}, "title":{"label":"Just keeps getting worse"}, "content":{"label":"There was a time I would not hesitate to recommend Overcast, but something seems to have come apart recently. Usually updates make an appearance better, but Overcast only seems to be going in the opposite direction. Sad, given how rock solid and dependable it used to be. Currently looking at going back to Apple (bummer).\n\nProblems I have run into include.\n1. Download fails requiring repeatedly releasing and redownloading episodes.\n2. Partial downloads ending prematurely and skipping to another episode automatically. This happens until the episode is deleted and redownloaded.\n3. Queue behaviour: how does it work? Who knows.\n4. Play next functionality: sometimes works sometimes doesn’t.\n\nTo add insult to injury the subscription price just almost doubled and they removed the dark sub-only icon in the process.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
