{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id495588755"}, "name":{"label":"Reviewer1556161"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-12T14:59:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.1"}, "id":{"label":"12649442244"}, "title":{"label":"Hit and miss download"}, "content":{"label":"Great app, terrible at downloading podcasts. Hit download, go to play the podcast, it’s failed to download. Happens all the time on wifi, the most basic function of a podcast app and they can’t get it right. Please fix this overcast! Sometimes it will get up to 80% then just fail to download. Make it so it keeps trying to download even after it fails. Very frustrating. A great app to use failed by its inability to consistently download podcasts.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id102294362"}, "name":{"label":"Kindofamacfan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-03T16:29:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12616388599"}, "title":{"label":"App includes its own ads"}, "content":{"label":"So annoying- this app applies its own ads to the podcast. Yes you can skip but it’s so sneaky and annoying. \n\nAfter years of use - I’m out clowns.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id132003153"}, "name":{"label":"D@voB"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-21T19:43:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12571467198"}, "title":{"label":"Unusable with new podcasts"}, "content":{"label":"I hope Marco reads this. I’ve used Overcast for years (I’m guessing close to 10) and generally have loved it. Sadly in the past year or so an issue has become so irritating that I have to write a negative review, sorry Marco. Whenever a new podcast is released from any of the people I follow I’ve learned not to try and download it immediately. If the podcast was released in the past hour or so forget about trying to listen to it on OC. You just get a spinning download wheel and nothing happens. You can shut the app down and restart. No luck. If you come back 24 hours later, no problem. When OC does this to me I go to Apple Podcasts and can listen to the episode immediately. What’s up with that??? Seriously if you can’t play the podcast for some download restrictions don’t tease us by showing there’s a new episode.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id29744595"}, "name":{"label":"DkamDkamDkam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-30T17:35:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12484695971"}, "title":{"label":"Links don’t work"}, "content":{"label":"This app is great if you use it in isolation, but sharing links with friends just doesn’t work. The links will open the app, but not load the podcast. There seems to be no way to log a bug and I’ve had no response via email.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id190124051"}, "name":{"label":"pique19"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-29T18:54:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12480826209"}, "title":{"label":"What’s going on?"}, "content":{"label":"Something’s going on w yr latest update.\nThe app keeps downloading every ep of every podcast I follow, quickly filling my phone and making it unusable.\nI didn’t change any settings.\nI recently deleted 196GB of content; it filled up again in 4 days.\nHow do I fix this?\n\nAlso:\n• I used to be able to set it so when an ep end it auto started the next.\nThat’s gone.\n• Now have to go thru more screens to get into/out of eps V annoying\n• Can no longer see my favourited eps list\n\nLast: the app CONSTANTLY syncs, making it unusable.\n\nThis used to be my fave podcast app.\nMight have to move to another.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id49983965"}, "name":{"label":"mthout"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-26T14:29:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12468110912"}, "title":{"label":"Still broken"}, "content":{"label":"Months after this major rewrite, it still constantly crashes while paused. Half the time, after you restart it, it either has removed the episode from the available list, or it restarts from 0:00. Incidentally, even when it doesn’t crash, it takes ages to update the feeds. Just a sluggish, buggy app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1368004413"}, "name":{"label":"I do not have Google Fibre"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-21T17:26:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12448466479"}, "title":{"label":"Constantly surprising behaviour. Unusable"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve use many podcasting apps in my time but I dare anybody to predict the next episode this one will play. I’ve tried the superstitious coping mechanisms mentioned on reddit threads: “leave the app open on the queue you want to listen to”, “only use play next”, “create your own queue”. Nothing works.\n\nThis is the only app in the world where “Play next”, doesn’t.\n\nAny time spent queuing up episodes for a long drive is futile: it will either play random things, or go silent. \n\nThere is nowhere in the UI that can tell you what it will play next, or why it’s stopped.\n\nOccasionally, it will just terminate an episode some minutes in and go to the next random choice. Immediately locating and playing the aborted episode resumes fine. But why did it skip? Is this a busted CD player?\n\nOther times, if I pull over to see if there is a reason for the silence and it’s not just \nsimply stopped, the play button is just spinning forever. I guess I had a momentary loss of data service, but why can every other podcast app happily resume? Closing the app & restarting it always seems to work… but why does it need such violence for routine operation? Is this a temperamental VHS player?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
