{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id28046374"}, "name":{"label":"Matthew T."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-02T18:07:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12137909821"}, "title":{"label":"Apple Watch app missing"}, "content":{"label":"I held off updating to the new version for a long time but finally updated this morning, and now the app has been removed from my Apple Watch. So it seems the Watch app was either removed or isn't compatible with watchOS 9, which isn't specified anywhere as far as I can see.\n\nThe Watch app was the primary reason I used Overcast in the first place. Why do things only seem to get worse with new software updates in recent years?? I regret updating because the app worked perfectly well before but now I've lost features and functionality.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
