{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id11099824"}, "name":{"label":"natman777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-22T03:36:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12092315850"}, "title":{"label":"Was brilliant"}, "content":{"label":"With the cosmetic change the interface was improved but now podcast will just disappear from the queue or will play for a part of the podcast then disappear and go to the next one. This happens on any podcast that is older the last 3 current ones. Extremely disappointing. Time to look for an alternative.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id264620904"}, "name":{"label":"Alfwiedersehen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-21T15:16:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12090524450"}, "title":{"label":"My favourite app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been a podcast fan for so many years. Love all the different ideas and stories. I listen to a couple of hours a day. I’ve been using Overcast the entire time (on their free version). \n\nRecently, I looked again at whether I should switch to another one but I found Overcast was just so much better for how I want to use it. \n\nThe features are great! The new big update had a few teething issues but it helped me set up a new way of automating my favourite podcasts. \n\nI only recently discovered that it’s all created and looked after by a single person! \n\nI finally made the decision to subscribe to this app, not because it unlocks any features I want, but because I get so much value from this app every day, especially from the well-thought out features and customisation it lets me do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
